  "bodyHash": "lW6ni0oDJyE=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#808080\">注意：</span><span style=\"color:#f00\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API </a><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">為必要前置模組</a></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\">覺得喝原版藥水很麻煩？戰鬥時翻背包找藥水手忙腳亂？藥水喝完後的廢棄玻璃瓶讓妳難以處理？那麼，這款模組參考了逃離塔科夫的激素針設計，幫助妳在戰鬥中從容合理地使用各種藥水。註：適合遊戲難度稍高的玩家。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><img src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/imgs/2023/11/04/23ee69e929a659ee.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fc0\">在飾品欄裝備後，按B鍵開啟注射器背帶，按J鍵開啟食物儲存袋</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fc0\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\">模組聯動</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/health-disease\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#808080\">Health&amp;Disease</span></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
